# C# Logging

- **Logging**: Use `LoggerMessage` delegates, NEVER `Logger.LogError()`.

  ```csharp
  private static readonly Action<ILogger, Exception?> LogEvent = LoggerMessage.Define(LogLevel.Information, new EventId(1, "Event"), "Event occurred");
  ```